WEBVTT

00:11.400 --> 00:14.745
FLIGHT CONTROLS ON! NOBODY PANIC!

00:16.300 --> 00:18.543
THAT WAS A LOAD-BEARING GARAGE!

00:22.100 --> 00:23.327
WHICH ONE IS DOWN?!

00:31.050 --> 00:33.953
I HAVE MADE A TERRIBLE PURCHASE!

00:36.700 --> 00:39.976
I CAN STILL LAND THIS! I CAN STILL LAND THIS!

00:53.700 --> 00:54.980
DID I DO A GOOD JOB?!

00:59.350 --> 01:00.650
ABORT! ABORT!

01:00.800 --> 01:02.000
NOT THE PORSCHE!

01:02.120 --> 01:03.170
WARRANTY!

01:05.000 --> 01:06.500
NAILED IT!

01:06.600 --> 01:08.760
BRAKES! BRAAAKES!

01:09.050 --> 01:10.910
MY SPINE!

01:12.200 --> 01:14.974
EXCELLENT DATA! TERRIBLE LANDING!
